# Wanted (IDEAS I17; QUESTIONS Q29, 8; board 0.9 and 0.10). Fails until it is answered; then it moves up into collab/scenarios.
# Story: a person has five windows open. Whatever happens that they did not ask for, a start, a pause and resume, a window that closes,
# every window they could see they still see. And every open window, the minimized one too, is in Arbor's list of windows.
open Safari
open Notes
open Mail
open Music
open Preview
dock 101 left
dock 102 right
minimize 105
relaunch
expect visible 101
expect visible 102
expect visible 103
expect visible 104
toggle-pause
toggle-pause
expect visible 103
expect visible 104
zoom 101
expect visible 103
expect visible 104
close 101
expect visible 102
expect visible 103
expect visible 104
# The list the menu shows, as a command, by app: every open window, with what is out of view marked.
windows
expect ok
expect replied Notes
expect replied Mail
expect replied Music
expect replied Preview
